WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.100
Shooting Stars by Polly Sweetnam. 

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.319
Lisa and Alice are friends.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.502
They are on a plane.

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:31.184
They are watching a film.

00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:33.716
They are on holiday.

00:00:33.776 --> 00:00:38.386
They are going to an island in Greece.

00:00:38.446 --> 00:00:41.354
Look, Alice!

00:00:41.414 --> 00:00:43.474
There's Matt Lepardi.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:45.165
He's great!

00:00:45.225 --> 00:00:47.986
He's my favourite film star.

00:00:48.046 --> 00:00:50.877
Our holiday is starting well.

00:00:50.937 --> 00:00:54.258
Matt Lepardi loves Claudia Carman.

00:00:54.318 --> 00:00:56.018
She's his fiancée.

00:00:56.078 --> 00:00:58.019
They are going to get married.

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:01.720
She's a film star too.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:05.792
This is the Hotel Oracle.

00:01:05.852 --> 00:01:11.022
Lisa and Alice are going to stay here.

00:01:11.082 --> 00:01:15.302
This is our hotel, Lisa.

00:01:15.362 --> 00:01:16.853
It's nice.

00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:19.524
Yes, it is nice.

00:01:19.584 --> 00:01:22.116
I'm very happy, Alice!

00:01:22.176 --> 00:01:25.590
We are going to see beautiful places.

00:01:25.649 --> 00:01:29.142
We are going to do interesting things.

00:01:29.202 --> 00:01:31.864
Will we meet new friends?

00:01:31.923 --> 00:01:38.716
Will we have an exciting adventure?

00:01:38.776 --> 00:01:46.208
This is beautiful! Look!
 
00:01:46.268 --> 00:01:49.468
The village is beside the sea.

00:01:49.528 --> 00:01:54.469
The buildings are white and the sea is blue.

00:01:54.529 --> 00:01:57.200
And there are fishing boats!

00:01:57.260 --> 00:02:01.790
Wow! Look at that big hotel there!
 
00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.371
It's the Hotel Astra.

00:02:04.431 --> 00:02:07.902
It's very large and expensive.

00:02:07.962 --> 00:02:11.034
Are famous people staying there?

00:02:11.094 --> 00:02:15.388
I want to see some famous people.

00:02:15.448 --> 00:02:20.320
Kostas and Eleni own the Hotel Oracle.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.592
They love their hotel.

00:02:22.652 --> 00:02:24.912
They like their guests.

00:02:24.972 --> 00:02:29.535
They cook wonderful food for the guests.

00:02:29.595 --> 00:02:35.548
That was a wonderful meal, Eleni. Thank you, Lisa.
 
00:02:35.608 --> 00:02:38.321
What can we do on this island?

00:02:38.381 --> 00:02:41.905
You can do lots of exciting things.

00:02:41.965 --> 00:02:44.426
You must visit the Museum.

00:02:44.486 --> 00:02:50.440
There are beautiful statues in the Museum.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:56.904
Lisa and Alice are enjoying their holiday.

00:02:56.964 --> 00:03:00.126
Each day they swim in the sea.

00:03:00.186 --> 00:03:04.128
Each day they eat delicious food.

00:03:04.188 --> 00:03:08.119
Today the girls are in the Museum.

00:03:08.179 --> 00:03:12.070
A guide is talking about a statue.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:16.444
Two other tourists are near Lisa and Alice.

00:03:16.504 --> 00:03:21.487
These tourists are talking about film stars.

00:03:21.547 --> 00:03:24.830
Look at this newspaper.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:29.343
Here's a story about Matt Lepardi and Claudia Carman.

00:03:29.403 --> 00:03:31.645
They are visiting this island.

00:03:31.704 --> 00:03:33.836
They are making a film here.

00:03:33.896 --> 00:03:37.060
They are shooting some scenes here.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:44.058
Matt Lepardi and Claudia Carman are staying on this island, Lisa!

00:03:44.117 --> 00:03:48.662
The Hotel Astra is big and expensive.

00:03:48.722 --> 00:03:51.184
Are they staying there?

00:03:51.243 --> 00:03:55.857
Will we see them?

00:03:55.917 --> 00:04:02.342
The next morning the sun is shining brightly.

00:04:02.402 --> 00:04:05.016
I'm going to go to the shops.

00:04:05.076 --> 00:04:09.503
I want to buy some postcards and some souvenirs.

00:04:09.562 --> 00:04:11.824
Do you want to come, Lisa?

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:13.286
No, thanks.

00:04:13.346 --> 00:04:15.017
My hair is wet.

00:04:15.077 --> 00:04:17.088
I'll sit on the balcony.

00:04:17.148 --> 00:04:20.852
The hot sun will dry my hair.

00:04:20.912 --> 00:04:24.024
Lisa is on the balcony.

00:04:24.084 --> 00:04:26.396
The sun is hot.

00:04:26.456 --> 00:04:29.950
Lisa looks at the Hotel Astra.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.722
It is a big and important hotel.

00:04:33.782 --> 00:04:37.084
Then Lisa sees two people.

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:40.714
They are on the balcony of the Hotel Astra.

00:04:40.774 --> 00:04:43.675
The woman is looking at the sea.

00:04:43.735 --> 00:04:47.426
The man is looking at the woman.

00:04:47.485 --> 00:04:53.096
It's Claudia Carman and Matt Lepardi!

00:04:53.156 --> 00:04:55.867
Claudia is sad.

00:04:55.927 --> 00:04:57.400
Why?

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.928
Matt isn't sad.

00:04:59.988 --> 00:05:02.765
He is angry.

00:05:02.825 --> 00:05:06.173
Now Matt is shouting at Claudia.

00:05:06.233 --> 00:05:08.173
He is angry.

00:05:08.233 --> 00:05:10.704
Claudia is angry too.

00:05:10.764 --> 00:05:13.744
She is shouting at Matt.

00:05:13.804 --> 00:05:20.376
Lisa can see Claudia and Matt, but she can't hear their words.

00:05:20.436 --> 00:05:25.648
Suddenly, Matt pulls Claudia into their room.

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:27.318
Oh no!

00:05:27.378 --> 00:05:29.508
This is terrible!

00:05:29.568 --> 00:05:32.866
Matt is hurting Claudia.

00:05:32.926 --> 00:05:35.504
What shall I do?

00:05:35.564 --> 00:05:39.024
Claudia and Matt are in their room.

00:05:39.084 --> 00:05:42.695
Claudia takes a gun from her bag.

00:05:42.755 --> 00:05:46.016
Lisa sees everything.

00:05:46.076 --> 00:05:49.826
Lisa hears the sound of the gun.

00:05:49.886 --> 00:05:54.417
Matt falls onto the sofa.

00:05:54.437 --> 00:05:57.558
Oh no! Is he dead?
 
00:05:57.618 --> 00:06:00.528
Claudia is on the balcony.

00:06:00.588 --> 00:06:03.202
The gun is in her hand.

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:05.857
She sees Lisa.

00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:09.050
Claudia is looking at me.

00:06:09.109 --> 00:06:11.432
She has the gun.

00:06:11.492 --> 00:06:14.374
She is going to shoot me.

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:18.678
She is going to kill me!

00:06:18.738 --> 00:06:23.672
I must find Kostas and Eleni.

00:06:23.732 --> 00:06:26.604
They will help me.

00:06:26.664 --> 00:06:31.052
Lisa is in the Hotel Oracle's restaurant.

00:06:31.112 --> 00:06:35.168
But she can't find Kostas and Eleni.

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:40.140
Suddenly, Lisa sees a man and a woman.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.700
They are standing by the door.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:47.171
Please, don't be frightened.

00:06:47.231 --> 00:06:49.742
We want to talk to you.

00:06:49.802 --> 00:06:52.613
Everything is OK.

00:06:52.673 --> 00:06:55.184
Matt is not dead.

00:06:55.244 --> 00:06:59.714
Claudia and I are making a film on the island.

00:06:59.774 --> 00:07:03.570
In the film, I fight with Claudia.

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:05.881
Claudia kills me.

00:07:05.941 --> 00:07:09.582
We practise our scenes in our hotel room.

00:07:09.642 --> 00:07:12.104
The gun is not real.

00:07:12.164 --> 00:07:15.035
Claudia will never hurt me.

00:07:15.095 --> 00:07:17.406
I will never hurt her.

00:07:17.466 --> 00:07:20.737
We love each other very much.

00:07:20.797 --> 00:07:27.640
Wow! Claudia Carman and Matt Lepardi are here!

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:30.652
They're talking to Lisa!

00:07:30.712 --> 00:07:35.100
Lisa is having an exciting adventure. 

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:52.000
And I have six postcards and some souvenirs!